---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title="DraftTrail Terms of Use" description="Terms of Use for DraftTrail for Mac." />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main id="main">
      <article class="policy tile">
        <p class="tile-kicker">DraftTrail · macOS</p>
        <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
        <p class="date"><strong>Last updated: October 25, 2026.</strong></p>
        <p>DraftTrail is a local document comparison and reviewed file-organization tool. Use it only with files you are authorized to access. Apple's <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/">Licensed Application End User License Agreement</a> applies to an App Store copy.</p>
        <h2>Review before changing files</h2>
        <p>You remain responsible for choosing the current document, reviewing suggested relationships and approving each file action. Text extraction has format and coverage limits. A matching-text result does not establish visual identity, legal equivalence, approval or completeness. DraftTrail is not a backup service or a substitute for reviewing important documents.</p>
        <p>Keep an independent backup before organizing important work. Undo depends on retained history, valid access and unchanged file identities and contents. External edits, missing files, storage failures or an interrupted operation can require manual recovery. The app does not promise that every file or interrupted operation can be restored automatically.</p>
        <h2>Purchase access</h2>
        <p>DraftTrail offers included comparisons and an optional one-time Pro unlock. Supported formats and technical safety limits still apply. Apple's localized purchase screen controls the amount charged; Apple handles payments, restoration and refunds. A verified lifetime entitlement is preserved when current offers or prices change, unless Apple refunds or revokes that purchase. No recurring subscription is part of the initial offer, and there is no promise of all future products or updates forever.</p>
        <h2>Your files and local data</h2>
        <p>Your documents remain yours. DraftTrail claims no ownership of them and does not upload them. Local app data and history can be lost if storage is removed or fails; there is no developer-operated backup. Details are in the <a href="/drafttrail/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>For help, contact <a href="mailto:randyventures06@gmail.com?subject=DraftTrail">randyventures06@gmail.com</a>. Nothing in these terms excludes rights that apply under local consumer law.</p>
        <p class="links"><a href="/drafttrail/support/">Support</a> · <a href="/drafttrail/privacy/">Privacy</a> · <a href="/drafttrail/terms/">Terms of Use</a></p>
      </article>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
<style>
  .policy { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .policy h2 { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .date { color: var(--ink-muted); }
  .links { margin-top: 2rem; }
</style>
